@startuml AD-5
!include _style.iuml
title AD-5 (System level) — Get station suggestion\nTrigger: Driver opens "Suggested for You" · Use cases: UC-CHG-07, UC-CHG-01 · Rules: BR-P32, BR-P33, BR-P39, BR-P41

|«person»\nDriver|
|«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
|«external system»\nMap & Routing\nService|
|«person»\nDriver|
start
:Choose Fastest or Cheapest,\noptionally enter battery %\nand target charge (default 80%);
|«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
:Find stations compatible with the\nvehicle, not Faulted or Offline;
if ( ) then ([battery % entered])
  :Drop stations beyond\nbattery % × rated range × 0.8;
else ([else])
endif
if ( ) then ([no candidate station])
  :Tell Driver no compatible\nstation is in range;
  stop
else ([candidates found])
endif
:Request travel times\nto candidate stations>
|«external system»\nMap & Routing\nService|
:Return travel times>
|«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
if ( ) then ([routing error\nor timeout])
  :Estimate travel time from straight-line\ndistance ÷ 30 km/h, mark approximate;
else ([travel times received])
endif
:Estimate wait on arrival per connector\n(free now, time left, or hold end);
:Estimate charging time to target\nand cost at the arrival tariff period;
:Add reliability penalty (+10 min, label)\nfor 7-day uptime < 80%, an open reported\nissue, or out-of-date status;
if ( ) then ([Fastest])
  :Score by travel + wait\n+ charging time;
else ([Cheapest])
  :Score by estimated cost,\nties broken by time;
endif
:Keep the top three and show them\nwith reasons (drive, wait, time, cost);
|«person»\nDriver|
if ( ) then ([Driver taps Navigate])
  :Open navigation to\nthe chosen station;
  stop
else ([else])
  if ( ) then ([Driver taps Reserve on an\nAvailable connector (Should)])
    :Reserve a charging\nconnector ⋔ (AD-4);
    stop
  else ([Driver leaves the list])
    stop
  endif
endif
@enduml
